  "description": "How do you win over your husband... while in another woman's body? That's precisely the task at hand for Adeline Tiaget - formally known as Charlotte Valerian. When Charlotte's step-father's incessant scheming leads her to be poisoned to death, she is given a chance to live on in the body of the most beautiful woman in the empire. Now, all there's left to do is exact her revenge and make her former husband fall in love with her again. \n\n(Source: POCKET COMICS)\n\n*Note: First released in English, with the initial eligible release in Japanese followed by Korean, making it a manga by our standards.*",
